              "value": "Blood-Fueled Titter"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "If the shatterling attempts an Intimidation check to Demoralize a target within 30 feet of a creature with persistent bleed damage, the shatterling has +4 circumstance bonus to the Intimidation check. In addition, the shatterling takes no penalty to the check for not speaking a language the target can hear, and the target isn't temporarily immune to the shatterling's attempts to Demoralize it unless the shatterling critically fails its Intimidation check."
